---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Field Survey & Clinical Research Blog | Pharos University">
	<style>
		.blog-header-nav {
			padding: 24px 60px;
			border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grid);
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			background: var(--bg-canvas);
		}

		.blog-container {
			max-width: 900px;
			margin: 60px auto;
			padding: 0 24px;
		}

		.blog-tag {
			font-family: var(--font-mono);
			font-size: 12px;
			font-weight: 800;
			color: var(--accent-container);
			letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		}

		.blog-title {
			font-size: 42px;
			font-weight: 900;
			margin: 16px 0 24px;
			line-height: 1.1;
		}

		.blog-card-item {
			border: 1px solid var(--border-grid);
			padding: 32px;
			margin-bottom: 32px;
			background: var(--bg-muted);
		}

		.blog-link {
			display: inline-block;
			margin-top: 16px;
			font-family: var(--font-mono);
			font-size: 12px;
			font-weight: 700;
			color: var(--accent-blue);
			text-decoration: none;
		}
	</style>

	<header class="blog-header-nav">
		<div>
			<span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; background: var(--text-primary); color: white; padding: 4px 8px;">ASTRO BLOG</span>
			<strong style="margin-left: 12px; font-size: 14px;">Pharos University Hemodialysis Research Hub</strong>
		</div>
		<a href="/" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent-blue); text-decoration: none;">&larr; BACK TO SCROLLTELLING LANDING</a>
	</header>

	<main class="blog-container">
		<div class="blog-tag">FIELD SURVEY ARTICLES & CLINICAL AUDITS</div>
		<h1 class="blog-title">Hemodialysis Unit Field Research & Incident Analysis</h1>
		<p style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 48px;">
			Documenting clinical survey findings, paper vital log audits, chloramine neglect patterns, and MedGemma fine-tuning milestones.
		</p>

		<article class="blog-card-item">
			<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent-sky); font-weight: 700;">DATA-DRIVEN STITCH PAGE // ARXIV:2507.11842 • COHORT 18–24 (PRIMARY)</div>
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 12px 0;">Point-of-Care MedGemma-4B CPOE Interception &amp; 0.941 AUROC IDH Forecasting</h2>
			<p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
				Synthesized via Jules + Google Stitch MCP from Firecrawl competitor gap analysis and arXiv literature. Benchmarks 0.941 AUROC hypotension forecasting (22-minute lead time) alongside pre-session CPOE prescription safety gates.
			</p>
			<a href="/blog/medgemma-cpoe-idh-prediction-2026" class="blog-link">READ DATA-DRIVEN CLINICAL REPORT &rarr;</a>
		</article>

		<article class="blog-card-item">
			<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent-sky); font-weight: 700;">DATA-DRIVEN STITCH PAGE // FIRECRAWL INTEL • COHORT 35–44</div>
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 12px 0;">Zero-Override Dialysis Ward Protocol: Cutting Alert Fatigue by 64% with Dual-Shield AI</h2>
			<p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
				Created by Jules + Stitch MCP via the <code>.stitch/next-prompt.md</code> baton loop for Attending Nephrologists &amp; Clinical Informatics Leads. Audited by OpenSEO (98/100).
			</p>
			<a href="/blog/nephrology-ward-cpoe-override-audit-2026" class="blog-link">READ 35–44 CLINICIAN PROTOCOL &rarr;</a>
		</article>

		<article class="blog-card-item">
			<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent-sky); font-weight: 700;">DATA-DRIVEN STITCH PAGE // ARXIV:2509.04119 • COHORT 25–34</div>
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 12px 0;">Quantized ONNX Runtime Inference on Bedside Embedded SoCs for Zero-Cloud Telemetry</h2>
			<p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
				Created by Jules + Stitch MCP via the Observation Deck Orchestrator bridge for Clinical Engineering Residents. Benchmarks 180ms INT8/FP16 bedside gateway execution.
			</p>
			<a href="/blog/edge-onnx-dialysis-telemetry-benchmarks-2026" class="blog-link">READ 25–34 EDGE ONNX BENCHMARK &rarr;</a>
		</article>

		<article class="blog-card-item">
			<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent-critical); font-weight: 700;">ARTICLE // CLINICAL AUDIT</div>
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 12px 0;">London & Seoul Dialysis Unit Outbreaks: Field Survey & Chloramine Neglect Patterns</h2>
			<p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
				Analysis of 60+ unescalated chloramine neglect episodes identified during unit audits in Egypt. Comparing water loop conductivity failure modes against historical catastrophes in London (Hard Water Syndrome) and Seoul (Chloramine Hemolysis).
			</p>
			<a href="/blog/dialysis-field-survey-incidents" class="blog-link">READ FULL MDX FIELD SURVEY ARTICLE &rarr;</a>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>
